{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00899-00005","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["이란의 이슬람 혁명은 지난해로 40주년을 맞았다","12명으로 이뤄진 감독자평의회가 있어 상원 역할을 한다"],"reason":"Key facts (the 8-year Assembly of Experts term, the Guardian Council's 12 members, Khamenei's background, the patronage complaints) are preserved. It is awkward in places: the heading fragment '최고지도자 하메네이, 혁명수비대 감독관 출신' is copied in as is, and the 40th-anniversary sentence comes first with no link to the rest. It omits the Khomeini succession and the 1989 date."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["이슬람 법학자 6명과 일반 법학자 6명","능력이 아닌 낙하산으로 공직을 맡은 사람도 적지 않아"],"reason":"It accurately covers the checks on the Supreme Leader, the Guardian Council, Khamenei's background, and the patronage complaints. The copied heading fragment makes it a little awkward, and the Khomeini succession is missing."},"C":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["하메네이는 어려서 이슬람 종교학교에 다닐 당시 호메이니의 제자였다","호메이니는 제자인 하메네이를 수도 테헤란의 금요예배 이맘에 임명했다"],"reason":"It garbles who did what: it makes Khamenei the one who returned from Paris and who appointed an imam, whereas the source says Khomeini did both. It repeats one sentence and leaves out the governance structure and the reform discussion."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["하메네이는 호메이니가 1989년 세상을 떠나자 오른팔이던 알리 하메네이가 자리를 이어","호메이니가 ... 하메네이를 ... 임명했다. 자신의 오른팔로 공인한 셈이다"],"reason":"The appointment power is attributed to the Supreme Leader and the 8-year Experts term is covered. But the sentence '1989년 세상을 떠나자 오른팔로 공인해지고' garbles the cause and effect, and it suggests Khamenei died in 1989 or was recognized then. That distorts the facts."}}}
